  m_text: 'UI Furnace Grid Guide (Lite) is an editor tool for Unity that adds a precision
    grid and snapping system to the UI workflow, making it easier to design clean,
    well-aligned interfaces.


    Designing UI in Unity can often involve manual
    adjustments and guesswork when trying to align elements consistently. This tool
    solves that problem by providing a visual grid overlay directly in the Scene
    view, along with snapping support for accurate positioning.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
